Package: libitute164
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ITU-T E.164 phone number manipulation tools and data
 libitute164 provides tooling and runtime numbering-plan data for handling
 phone numbers in the ITU-T E.164 standard.
 .
 It includes a validator for external numbering-plan files used by the
 development library.
